><span begin="00:37.377" end="00:38.387">this)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.657" end="00:42.437"><span begin="00:38.657" end="00:38.877">I've </span><span begin="00:38.877" end="00:39.227">gone </span><span begin="00:39.227" end="00:39.297">too </span><span begin="00:39.297" end="00:39.737">far </span><span begin="00:39.737" end="00:39.907">to </span><span begin="00:39.907" end="00:40.227">come </span><span begin="00:40.227" end="00:40.477">back </span><span begin="00:40.477" end="00:40.877">from </span><span begin="00:40.877" end="00:41.986">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.986" end="00:44.966"><span begin="00:41.986" end="00:42.186">But </span><span begin="00:42.186" end="00:42.606">you </span><span begin="00:42.606" end="00:42.856">don't </span><span begin="00:42.856" end="00:43.176">have </span><span begin="00:43.176" end="00:43.416">a </span><span begin="00:43.416" end="00:45.206">clue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.206" end="00:49.796"><span begin="00:45.206" end="00:45.376">You </span><span begin="00:45.376" end="00:45.616">don't </span><span begin="00:45.616" end="00:45.826">know </span><span begin="00:45.826" end="00:46.086">what </span><span begin="00:46.086" end="00:46.366">you </span><span begin="00:46.366" end="00:47.956">do </span><span begin="00:47.956" end="00:48.616">to </span><span begin="00:48.616" end="00:49.796">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.796" end="00:52.626"><span begin="00:49.796" end="00:50.076">Won't </span><span begin="00:50.076" end="00:50.636">someone </span><span begin="00:50.636" end="00:50.916">stop </span><span begin="00:50.916" end="00:51.256">this </span><span begin="00:51.256" end="00:53.746">song </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.746" end="00:55.834"><span begin="00:53.746" end="00:53.915">So </span><span begin="00:53.915" end="00:54.135">I </span><span begin="00:54.135" end="00:54.214">won't </span><span begin="00:54.214" end="00:54.744">sing </span><span begin="00:54.74